  "description": {
    "text": "McDonald's Original Pokémon Card Game DP: one of seven cards came with every Happy Meal at McDonald's in Japan from 18 to 31 May 2007, along with a toy, which card a surprise. All seven, 027 to 033 DP-P, show Pokémon new to Diamond & Pearl: Turtwig, Chimchar, Piplup, Palkia, Drifblim, Croagunk and Dialga. On 19 May only, Happy Meals also came with a poster of the stars of the Pokémon films, first come, first served.",
